Hi Bonnie,

Another option that's out there is to use the sqldf package, especially for those with some SQL query writing experience:

library(sqldf)
sqldf("SELECT SubID, Date, Age, Gender FROM df GROUP BY SubID")

  SubID       Date Age Gender

1    17 2009-01-23  27      M

2    32 2011-03-13  39      F
3    53 2010-09-07  60      F

- Patrick

